  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Terminator insulation and read-through between adjacent units"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Quantify transcriptional read-through, because a multi-unit gate is only as modular as its terminators."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Why this must precede assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A three-input gate places three transcription units on one plasmid. If unit 1 reads through into unit 2, the gate has an input it was never designed to have \u2014 and it will look like crosstalk, or like a bad fusion site, or like anything except what it is."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Design"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tandem reporter construct: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-525cf33d",
              "label": "J23106",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
